msgctxt "Addon Summary"
msgid "Sega - MS/GG/MD/CD (Genesis Plus GX Wide)"
msgstr "Sega — MS/GG/MD/CD (Genesis Plus GX Wide)"

msgctxt "Addon Description"
msgid "A widescreen modification of Genesis Plus GX, a Sega/Genesis/Mega CD emulator that originally ran on the GameCube."
msgstr "Широкоэкранная модификация Genesis Plus GX, эмулятора Sega/Genesis/Mega CD, который изначально работал на GameCube."

